fying run was led by " [:a {:href "/athletes/101102"} "Fabienne Reuteler"] " (SUI) with the 1998 bronze medalist, " [:a {:href "/athletes/99718"} "Shannon Dunn-Downing"] " (USA), in second. France’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/99732"} "Doriane Vidal"] " posted the highest score in the first run of the final, with 43.0, followed by Clark with 40.8. But Clark’s second run score of 47.9 easily won her the gold medal, with Vidal taking silver, and the bronze going to Reuteler."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Qualifying Round 1"] [:th {} "Qualifying Round 2"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/101100"} "Kelly Clark"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "42.1 (1)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "47.9 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/99732"} "Doriane Vidal"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} "38.3 (3)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "43.0 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/101102"} "Fabienne Reuteler"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SUI"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SUI.png"}] "SUI"]] [:td {} "32.0 (7)"] [:td {} "40.4 (1)"] [:td {} "39.7 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style 